AraunaPorto_Text_CiroTravelPrompt::
	.string "The east path joins the coast\n"
	.string "road to PORTO DAS REDES.\p"
	.string "Travel there with CIRO now?$"

AraunaPorto_Text_CiroStay::
	.string "CIRO: I will wait here.\p"
	.string "Use the east path when you are\n"
	.string "ready.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_CoastRoadDeparture::
	.string "The east path meets the coast\n"
	.string "road. CIRO leads the way.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_FisherArrival::
	.string "This is PORTO DAS REDES,\n"
	.string "though the signs forgot it.\p"
	.string "Find DONA CELINA in town.\n"
	.string "She keeps the House of Tide.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_FisherMemorial::
	.string "These stones carry the names\n"
	.string "of fishers the flood took.\p"
	.string "We sang each name at dawn.\n"
	.string "Since the water paled, no one\n"
	.string "can finish the refrain.\p"
	.string "Your notebook records the names.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_FisherRiverWarning::
	.string "The river tastes of iron now.\p"
	.string "Ask at the docks. Someone still\n"
	.string "hums when the Agent is gone.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_FisherAfterTestimony::
	.string "I heard the old refrain again.\p"
	.string "The water has its color back,\n"
	.string "but those names still matter.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DischargePermit::
	.string "A metal plate bears a fresh\n"
	.string "CONSORTIUM seal.\p"
	.string "UPSTREAM MINE DISCHARGE\n"
	.string "AUTHORIZED -- CHANNEL 04.\p"
	.string "Your notebook copies the code.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DischargePermitRead::
	.string "The permit calls the pale water\n"
	.string "an acceptable discharge.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaracoFirstMeeting::
	.string "A thin melody drifts across\n"
	.string "the pale water.\p"
	.string "Something unseen answers in\n"
	.string "three notes, then falls silent.\p"
	.string "Your notebook marks IARACO:\n"
	.string "FORM UNCONFIRMED.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaracoNeedsStory::
	.string "The unseen singer answers once.\p"
	.string "It knows the melody, but the\n"
	.string "last verse is still missing.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaracoRestored::
	.string "You sing CELINA's completed\n"
	.string "refrain beside the current.\p"
	.string "A shape gathers in the spray.\n"
	.string "IARACO regains its color.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaraMaeTestimony::
	.string "The river rises without a wave.\p"
	.string "A deeper voice speaks through\n"
	.string "IARACO's final note:\p"
	.string "I clean the water.\n"
	.string "Your dead are cleaned by memory.\p"
	.string "IARA-MAE enters the notebook\n"
	.string "as your first TESTIMONY.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaCelinaIntroduction::
	.string "DONA CELINA: Zila sent you?\n"
	.string "Then look before you accuse.\p"
	.string "My husband left this net\n"
	.string "unfinished on the flood night.\p"
	.string "Find the names no one sings,\n"
	.string "the permit that paled our river,\n"
	.string "and the tune still at the docks.\p"
	.string "I will keep the final thread.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaCelinaWaiting::
	.string "DONA CELINA: A story needs every\n"
	.string "witness, especially the ones\n"
	.string "that disagree.\p"
	.string "Search the landing, the permit,\n"
	.string "the working docks, and the pale\n"
	.string "water south of town.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaCelinaEvidenceComplete::
	.string "DONA CELINA: Now the pattern\n"
	.string "shows itself.\p"
	.string "The Agent stands near the\n"
	.string "northern warehouses.\p"
	.string "Take all four truths to him.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaCelinaNetSong::
	.string "DONA CELINA: The Agent lied,\n"
	.string "but paper is not the full wound.\p"
	.string "My husband left one verse\n"
	.string "open in this embroidered net.\p"
	.string "Hold the loose end. I will sing\n"
	.string "the names; you carry the answer.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaCelinaReturnToRiver::
	.string "DONA CELINA: Take our finished\n"
	.string "refrain to the pale water south.\p"
	.string "Do not summon IARACO.\n"
	.string "Give it a reason to answer.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DockworkerSong::
	.string "DOCKWORKER: We stopped the dawn\n"
	.string "song after the flood.\p"
	.string "But CELINA's husband taught me\n"
	.string "one line before the water rose:\p"
	.string "Net remembers hand and name;\n"
	.string "tide returns what grief holds.\p"
	.string "You write the tune down.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DockworkerAfter::
	.string "DOCKWORKER: I know the line.\n"
	.string "I just forgot how to sing it.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_ConsortiumAgentDenial::
	.string "AGENT: Public access ends here.\p"
	.string "The channel is compliant.\n"
	.string "Bring evidence or move along.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_ConsortiumAgentConfrontation::
	.string "AGENT: A memorial, a work song,\n"
	.string "that net, and a permit code...\p"
	.string "You collected stories.\n"
	.string "I enforce registered facts.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_ConsortiumAgentPreparation::
	.string "The Agent seals the path.\p"
	.string "Your team is restored before\n"
	.string "the confrontation.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_ConsortiumAgentBattleIntro::
	.string "AGENT: Data does not yield\n"
	.string "to folklore!$"

AraunaPorto_Text_ConsortiumAgentBattleDefeated::
	.string "AGENT: Your evidence should not\n"
	.string "have this much weight...$"

AraunaPorto_Text_ConsortiumAgentAfterBattle::
	.string "AGENT: The permit is valid.\n"
	.string "The mine met every metric.\p"
	.string "If the river changed, that loss\n"
	.string "was never entered in our model.\p"
	.string "The Agent steps aside.\n"
	.string "Return to DONA CELINA.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_ConsortiumAgentAfter::
	.string "AGENT: I filed your complaint.\n"
	.string "The Consortium closed the file.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareTrialInvitation::
	.string "DONA CELINA: The river answered,\n"
	.string "but a keeper cannot depend\n"
	.string "on one miraculous tide.\p"
	.string "The TIDE VIGIL tests whether\n"
	.string "you can carry memory and act.\p"
	.string "Stand with this House.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareTrialBattleIntro::
	.string "CELINA: Read the current.\n"
	.string "Protect what it carries!$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareTrialBattleDefeated::
	.string "CELINA: You changed course\n"
	.string "without abandoning the names.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareTrialComplete::
	.string "The old landing answers your\n"
	.string "steady step.\p"
	.string "The TIDE VIGIL is complete.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaCelinaAwardBadge::
	.string "DONA CELINA: IARA-MAE did not\n"
	.string "choose you as an ornament.\p"
	.string "She trusted you with a duty.\n"
	.string "PORTO DAS REDES saw you listen.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareBadgeReceived::
	.string "{PLAYER} received the\n"
	.string "MARE BADGE!\p"
	.string "The House of Tide records your\n"
	.string "name beside the lost fishers.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaCelinaAfterBadge::
	.string "CELINA: The river remembers.\p"
	.string "Your next road climbs toward\n"
	.string "SERRA DO UIVO.\p"
	.string "Travel there now?$"
